  "@graph": [
    {
      "@id": "compiler:CpuTopologyImplementationPlan",
      "@type": "schema:TechArticle",
      "rdfs:label": "CPU topology — compiler implementation plan (Apple Silicon runtime)",
      "schema:headline": "CPU topology discovery: lexer through emitter; sysctl/runtime details Apple Silicon + macOS only",
      "schema:description": "Phased plan for CPU topology in the Silica compiler. Phases A–C are shared pipeline work; Phase G sysctl/runtime details and the machine-readable contract text apply only to Apple Silicon + macOS (this document is not a portable topology guide). Phase G emitter complete on that path (cpu_topology, cache/numa trees, core_capabilities sentinel). Phases D–F and H remain.",
      "schema:version": "1.0",
      "schema:datePublished": "2026-04-09",
      "schema:isBasedOn": {
        "@id": "compiler:HumanReadablePlan",
        "schema:name": "cpu_topology_implementation_plan.md",
        "schema:url": "./cpu_topology_implementation_plan.md"
      },
      "schema:about": {
        "@type": "schema:SoftwareSourceCode",
        "schema:programmingLanguage": "Silica",
        "schema:targetProduct": "silica-compiler (Phase 2 self-hosted)"
      },
      "compiler:specificationReferences": [
        "silica-specification.md — core affinity appendix, cpu_topology, core_info, spawn placement",
        "silica-specification.md — §22 actor builtins"
      ],
      "compiler:implementationContract": {
        "@type": "compiler:TopologyABI",
        "rdfs:comment": "Phase A freeze (Team Lead: compiler-first effects). Layout: cpu_topology fields in source order cores, numa_nodes, cache_hierarchy; core_info fields id, core_type, capabilities, frequency_mhz; core_type is efficiency | performance. Type names cpu_topology and core_info match the spec appendix. Self-hosted checker types: get_cpu_topology -> cpu_topology; get_core_capabilities(core_id) checks int64; get_efficiency_cores / get_performance_cores -> List[int64,normal] as in §22.10. Core-id lists in numa_info.cores and cache_level.shared_cores use List[int64,normal] in the spec appendix. Effects: all §22.10 CPU Affinity Functions require proc[concurrency], matching effect_checker_core builtin_fn_effects for get_cpu_topology, get_*_cores, get_core_capabilities, and pinning helpers—spec appendix updated accordingly. Apple Silicon emitter: get_core_capabilities returns a heap sentinel with id=-1 on failure (NULL only if sentinel malloc fails); success path frequency_mhz=0 (sysctl does not expose core GHz; optional future IOKit); capabilities=list of hw.optional.* sysctl tokens (hw. stripped) for flags==1; single NUMA memory_range uses hw.memsize, start=0, latency=0 as local self-distance; sysctl cache levels in prims_actors_runtime_asm.silica comments."
      },
      "compiler:phaseSequence": [
        { "@id": "compiler:PhaseA_ABI", "schema:position": 1 },
        { "@id": "compiler:PhaseB_Lexer", "schema:position": 2 },
        { "@id": "compiler:PhaseC_Parser", "schema:position": 3 },
        { "@id": "compiler:PhaseD_TypeChecker", "schema:position": 4 },
        { "@id": "compiler:PhaseE_EffectChecker", "schema:position": 5 },
        { "@id": "compiler:PhaseF_SIR", "schema:position": 6 },
        { "@id": "compiler:PhaseG_Emitter", "schema:position": 7 },
        { "@id": "compiler:PhaseH_Verification", "schema:position": 8 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "compiler:PhaseA_ABI",
      "@type": "compiler:PlanPhase",
      "rdfs:label": "Phase A — ABI and type layout freeze",
      "compiler:completionStatus": "complete",
      "compiler:dependsOn": [],
      "compiler:primaryTasks": [
        "Define or confirm cpu_topology and core_info memory layout and field order for the self-hosted compiler.",
        "Align spec appendix with type checker type names and tuple/struct access rules.",
        "Resolve purity vs effects for topology builtins once for type and effect checkers."
      ],
      "compiler:typicalSourcePaths": [],
      "aalang:recommendedTool": {
        "@id": "aalang:silica-cpu-topology-phase-a-abi-tool",
        "schema:name": "CPU Topology Phase A ABI Tool",
        "schema:url": "../compiler-building-tools/silica-cpu-topology-phase-a-abi-tool.jsonld"
      },
      "aalang:supplementaryTool": {
        "@id": "aalang:silica-compiler-phase-planning-tool",
        "schema:name": "Silica Compiler Phase Planning Tool",
        "schema:url": "../compiler-building-tools/silica-compiler-phase-planning-tool.jsonld",
        "rdfs:comment": "Optional cross-phase planning; Phase A topology ABI work is owned by the Phase A ABI tool."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "compiler:PhaseB_Lexer",
      "@type": "compiler:PlanPhase",
      "rdfs:label": "Phase B — Lexer",
      "compiler:completionStatus": "complete",
      "rdfs:comment": "2026-04-09: Audited src/lexer/lexer_keywords.silica and lexer_token_kind.silica. Spawn placement (core_id, core_set, performance_cores, efficiency_cores) and topology builtins (get_cpu_topology, get_efficiency_cores, get_performance_cores, get_core_capabilities) plus pin_actor_* / unpin / remove / set_priority / pin_actor_to_numa_node are mapped; is_actor_runtime_helper_kind matches parser initial_roles. No new spec spellings in silica-specification §22.4 / §22.10; token kind numeric IDs unchanged.",
      "compiler:dependsOn": ["compiler:PhaseA_ABI"],
      "compiler:primaryTasks": [
        "Audit keyword and token kind coverage for topology builtins and spawn placement keywords.",
        "Add tokens only if spec introduces new constructors or spellings."
      ],
      "compiler:typicalSourcePaths": [
        "compiler/silica-compiler/src/lexer/lexer_keywords.silica",
        "compiler/silica-compiler/src/lexer/lexer_token_kind.silica"
      ],
      "aalang:recommendedTool": {
        "@id": "aalang:silica-lexer-code-generator",
        "schema:name": "Silica Lexer Code Generator",
        "schema:url": "../compiler-building-tools/silica-lexer-code-generator.jsonld"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "compiler:PhaseC_Parser",
      "@type": "compiler:PlanPhase",
      "rdfs:label": "Phase C — Parser (capabilities)",
      "compiler:completionStatus": "complete",
      "compiler:dependsOn": ["compiler:PhaseB_Lexer"],
      "rdfs:comment": "2026-04-09: Comma/call_name constraints updated (capability_expr_int64_ops c5, capability_expr_float32 c5/c8) so spawn third-arg and get_core_capabilities(expr) share correct operand/call_name propagation; capability_actors documents Phase C surface.",
      "compiler:primaryTasks": [
        "Verify spawn optional third argument parses core_id and uint64 placement forms (type checker rejects lists, core_set, grouping atoms).",
        "Ensure get_core_capabilities and other affinity calls parse correct arity."
      ],
      "compiler:typicalSourcePaths": [
        "compiler/silica-compiler/src/parser/capabilities/capability_actors.silica"
      ],
      "aalang:recommendedTool": {
        "@id": "aalang:silica-parser-code-generator",
