    {
      "@id": "compiler:PhaseF_SIR",
      "@type": "compiler:PlanPhase",
      "rdfs:label": "Phase F — SIR generator",
      "compiler:dependsOn": ["compiler:PhaseD_TypeChecker", "compiler:PhaseA_ABI"],
      "compiler:primaryTasks": [
        "Lower get_cpu_topology to prims that match structured return lowering.",
        "If ABI requires multi-step construction, add or extend SIR terms accordingly."
      ],
      "compiler:typicalSourcePaths": [
        "compiler/silica-compiler/src/sir_generator/terms/actor_calls.silica",
        "compiler/silica-compiler/src/sir_generator/terms/terms.silica"
      ],
      "aalang:recommendedTool": {
        "@id": "aalang:silica-sir_generator_builder",
        "schema:name": "Silica SIR Generator Builder",
        "schema:url": "../compiler-building-tools/silica-sir_generator_builder.jsonld"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "compiler:PhaseG_Emitter",
      "@type": "compiler:PlanPhase",
      "rdfs:label": "Phase G — Emitter and runtime glue",
      "compiler:completionStatus": "complete",
      "rdfs:comment": "2026-04-09: Apple Silicon + macOS — _silica_rt_get_cpu_topology builds cpu_topology (sysctl core counts, hw.memsize, cache levels helper, numa/cache lists). _silica_rt_get_core_capabilities returns core_info or failure sentinel (id=-1). Success capabilities: _silica_rt_apple_hw_optional_caps_list (hw.optional.* tokens, hw. stripped). frequency_mhz=0 (sysctl has no core GHz). Atom table pre-seeds :efficiency and :performance. Non-Apple and non-macOS paths not implemented.",
      "compiler:dependsOn": ["compiler:PhaseF_SIR", "compiler:PhaseA_ABI"],
      "compiler:primaryTasks": [
        "Implement _silica_rt_get_cpu_topology to build cpu_topology instead of returning a null pointer stub.",
        "Complete _silica_rt_get_core_capabilities if still stubbed.",
        "Wire prims_actors.silica to correct calling convention for structured returns."
      ],
      "compiler:typicalSourcePaths": [
        "compiler/silica-compiler/src/emitter/apple_silicon/terms/prims/prims_actors_runtime_asm.silica",
        "compiler/silica-compiler/src/emitter/apple_silicon/terms/prims/prims_actors.silica",
        "compiler/silica-compiler/src/emitter/apple_silicon/atoms/atom_table.silica"
      ],
      "aalang:recommendedTool": {
        "@id": "aalang:silica-emitter_builder",
        "schema:name": "SIR Emitter Builder",
        "schema:url": "../compiler-building-tools/silica-emitter_builder.jsonld"
      }
    },
